# An untapped River Delta alone can pay for Duress but cannot pay two black mana for Hymn to Tourach (CR 601.2h, 605.3a).
[Bot1 Deck]
River Delta
Duress
Hymn to Tourach
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.River Delta.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Hymn to Tourach.Cast(Bot2; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.River Delta.Activate(Color: Black)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Duress.Colors = Black
Bot1.Battlefield.River Delta.Counters.Depletion = 1
